{"id":"n24546-1-12","stage":2,"title":"구역 · 区域","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24546-1-12-1","ko":"저기에 차를 세우는 게 어때요?","zh":"把车停在那边怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기에","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기에","audio":"/audio/f93d780041b136d31a70.mp3"}},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차를","audio":"/audio/c9101b9a3fcbc9e75de1.mp3"}},{"text":"세우는","meaning":"使停止","explanation":"세우다：使停止；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"7","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세우는","audio":"/audio/9e142f8a8949469cec31.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"使停止","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"使机器的运转停住。","pronunciation":["세우다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f7d5f1ff0c8f89d2950.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24546-1-12-2","ko":"저곳은 주차 금지 구역이니 다른 곳을 좀 더 찾아보죠.","zh":"那边是禁止停车的区域，我们再找别的地方吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저곳은","meaning":"那；地方，地区","explanation":"저：那；곳：地方，地区；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"},{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저곳은","audio":"/audio/c342a79b670652662ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"주차","meaning":"停车，停放车辆","explanation":"주차：停车，停放车辆","readings":[{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25986","senseId":"1","lemma":"주차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}},{"text":"금지","meaning":"禁止","explanation":"금지：禁止","readings":[{"term":"금지","audio":"/audio/c019e0d89b7506f26a52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41234","senseId":"1","lemma":"금지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금지","audio":"/audio/c019e0d89b7506f26a52.mp3"}},{"text":"구역이니","meaning":"区域","explanation":"구역：区域；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"구역","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24546","senseId":"1","lemma":"구역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구역이니","audio":"/audio/9e6ad8278abe3026ff1f.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"곳을","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳을","audio":"/audio/9cf3d4bf3e5f9b5dfc89.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아보죠.","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아보죠","audio":"/audio/b3f8bebb29e9aa6e9a0a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b